{
	chapter.64ABA10299571EB5.title: "Minecolonies Getting Started"
	quest.00BC418A997F66AE.quest_subtitle: "You're gonna need a lot of unobstructed water for this, but it's worth it!"
	quest.03FF3AD92A920E03.quest_subtitle: "You know what to do now. Build and place one of these. At this point your colonists have probably begged you for a warehouse which require delivery men, and a restaraunt. Just listen to them from  here on out."
	quest.0926B7A374DCDB1B.quest_subtitle: "How does that saying go? Teach a player to fish and they eat forever?"
	quest.2AFF740EC98C2BBF.quest_subtitle: "Place it with the build tool (i know, i called it soemthing else)"
	quest.3069ABEDCED7A525.quest_desc: ["You must name your town before the townhall you placed is recognized. "]
	quest.33A1E9987B7AE6D9.quest_subtitle: "You will need lots of wood so this is the logical next step."
	quest.495A1C831668258A.quest_desc: ["Craft one to gain the diamond, remember to place it using the wand of placement."]
	quest.495A1C831668258A.quest_subtitle: "The supply things I was talking about."
	quest.52070FFF95B8688D.quest_desc: [
		"There are some extra mods here in addition to Minecolonies."
		""
		"But to get started all you really have to do is build a supply camp or supply ship and successfully place it."
		""
		"Then inside one of the chests will be a townhall block and rod of placement."
		""
		"Place the townhall block somewhere to get basic land protection of approximately 8 chunks radius."
		""
		"Placing the townhall block will also get  you 4 citizens during the course of the next hour after placing it."
		""
		"Now you need to build a builders hut and place it."
		""
		"Eventually one of your citizens will be the builder."
		""
		"And now you can start building your colony. Always check the townhall block to see what your colony needs, as well as check the chat messages."
		""
		"If you require other quest nodes and lines, join my Discord and let me know. Thanks."
		""
		"-- Kreezxil"
	]
	quest.6739787E8FEC5C9A.quest_subtitle: "Your colonist need to eat, build and place one of these."
	quest.6D925431AA231A60.quest_desc: ["Then right click the builder or the hut block to find out what is missing and put those items into the hut block's inventory."]
	quest.6D925431AA231A60.quest_subtitle: "On the hut block you placed, it says \"build options\" click that, and choose \"build\""
	quest.6E60E8100424928B.quest_desc: ["You’re probably tempted to build another building, but that will put you in a bind. Instead we’re going to place 3 citizen huts. Each hut grants 2 beds and therefore 2 citizens. That will fully cover the 4 citizens you have now and cause 2 babies to show up. When they grow up they’ll do other jobs. Remember to build huts once in a while. However it’s more advantageous to upgrade a hut into a better version of itself."]
	quest.6E60E8100424928B.title: "What Next?"
	quest.720DD64764D860F5.quest_subtitle: "build and place three of these."
	quest.7938F1B0376F08F9.quest_desc: [
		"You won't get a single thing built if you don't build and place this block first."
		""
		"Do not build your town hall until you have the basic huts built and the builder hut is at level 2."
		""
	]
	quest.7938F1B0376F08F9.quest_subtitle: "The most essential building"
	task.03B25A376AAB8D5B.title: "Work that builder!"
	task.169B66A197D82DAC.title: "You're probably tempted to build another building, but that will put you in a bind. Instead we're going to place 3 citizen huts. Each hut grants 2 beds and therefore 2 citizens. That will fully cover the 4 citizens you have now and cause 2 babies to show up. When they grow up they'll do other jobs. Remember to build huts once in a while. However it's more advantageous to upgrade a hut into a better version of itself."
	task.6CF22D535559AF9E.title: "Welcome to MCGS"
	task.7B7C2DCA503C5433.title: "Name your town"
}
